{"author":{"id":"1949ffc23f11a8cb4f8c42a45c9ad241b49570df9a18687489e9ea78d87c54a3"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1774301286,"nonce":"Ju4VSd420O76W9jojz1W/Mp4TeU=","message":"**Implementation spec**\n\n## Design decisions\n- FigureOutputPin rendered as a small circle on the right side of analysis nodes (below port handles)\n- Matches existing Handle styling: 8px, border-white, shadow-soft\n- Color-coded status: gray (idle), blue (running), green (cached/ready), red (error)\n- Click: POST to /api/figures/generate with analysis node ID + requested_outputs\n- Context menu: Generate, Force Re-run, View Figure (reuses PortContextMenu pattern)\n- Figure preview: modal overlay with Plotly JSON rendered inline\n\n## Components\n- `FigureOutputPin.tsx`: Handle-like element with status indicator, click handler, context menu\n  - Positioned below the last output port on the right side\n  - Pulse animation while running (animate-pulse on blue state)\n- `demandStore.ts`: Zustand store tracking:\n  - generation requests: Map\u003cnodeId, {status, figureHash?, error?}\u003e\n  - requestGeneration(nodeId), cancelGeneration(nodeId), setResult(nodeId, result)\n- `figureAPI.ts`: API client functions:\n  - generateFigure(nodeId, options): POST /api/analysis/generate\n  - getFigureStatus(requestId): GET /api/analysis/status/:id\n  - getFigureData(figureHash): GET /api/figures/:hash/file?format=json\n\n## Integration\n- CustomNode checks if node has analysis metadata with make_figs, renders FigureOutputPin\n- FigureOutputPin uses demandStore for status tracking\n- Preview modal uses existing Plotly figure rendering","files":null}]}